  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Brandish the Elemental Splendor of Genies</p></blockquote><p>Paladins sworn to the Oath of the Noble Genies revere the forces of the Elemental Planes, drawing power from the four kinds of genies: the dao, masters of earth; the djinn, masters of air; the efreet, masters of fire; and the marids, masters of water. In Faerûn, many of them hail from Calimshan, a land teeming with genies.</p><p>These Paladins often undertake quests that take them across the Realms and the multiverse, including the Elemental Planes.</p><p>These Paladins share the following tenets:</p><ul><li>Sow the seeds of creation amid the ashes of destruction.</li><li>Lead with splendor and grace.</li><li>Respect the elements, and fear their wrath.</li></ul><h3>Oath of the Noble Genies Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.U7Dl24fX93uEPyS8]{Elemental Smite}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.kzAJtLT0ytC6ACqH]{Genie Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.sDqDchNur3muOezY]{Genie's Splendor}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.nElOmvIpDHICtULw]{Aura of Elemental Shielding}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eCwXDiGVGzduKZWE]{Elemental Rebuke}</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.44eqvTQoH0XJpkrK]{Noble Scion}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Genie Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplChromaticO]{Chromatic Orb}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplElementali]{Elementalism}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.hWuxMbikbMf0O5Ix]{Thunderous Smite}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMirrorImag]{Mirror Image}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbPhantasmalFor]{Phantasmal Force}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFly0000000]{Fly}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGaseousFor]{Gaseous Form}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConjureMin]{Conjure Minor Elementals}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.pPR71jJhl0iussW0]{Summon Elemental}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.VtfkGJ41XMGE8iWF]{Banishing Smite}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplContactOth]{Contact Other Plane}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
